  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往维诺亚村医院（61.53）与佣兵艾里克（7.5）对话，每名队员，选“是”获得【火把】。",
      "type": "per-member-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "◆如果持有①支线任务获得的【贤者的戒指】、②第四步获得的【艾里克的大剑】、③第五步获得的【生命之花】，无法接到任务，需要扔掉。",
      "type": "start-item-block",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "2.出维诺亚村向北行走至芙蕾雅岛（370.400）再向北行走至（380.353）处，进入布满青苔的洞窟。",
      "type": "maze-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "◆布满青苔的洞窟为随机迷宫，约8层；",
      "type": "maze-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "魔物为Lv.17~19巨蝙蝠（属性：风70火30）、史莱姆（属性：地90风10）",
      "type": "maze-encounter",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "3.通过随机迷宫抵达叹息之森林，队伍一人与树精长老（29.13）对话，全员交出【火把】进入战斗。",
      "type": "party-exchange-battle",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "◆战斗信息：",
      "type": "battle-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "名称数量行动次数等级预估血量属性种族抗咒",
      "type": "battle-table-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "树精长老12352500地70水30邪魔系〇",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "技能攻击、圣盾、超强陨石魔法、超强冰冻魔法、",
      "type": "battle-skill",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "强力补血魔法（血量<25%时追加）、召唤异型蜂*2或者土蜘蛛*2（喽啰<4只时追加）",
      "type": "battle-skill",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "名称数量行动次数等级预估血量属性种族抗咒",
      "type": "battle-table-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "异型蜂2~3124~26400火50风50昆虫系×",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "技能攻击、攻击（血少者）、诸刃",
      "type": "battle-skill",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "名称数量行动次数等级预估血量属性种族抗咒",
      "type": "battle-table-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "土蜘蛛2~3124~26500地100昆虫系×",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "技能攻击、攻击（血多者）、防御、毒性攻击、昏睡攻击",
      "type": "battle-skill",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "4.战斗胜利后，转换场景至叹息森林，队伍中随机1人获得【艾里克的大剑】。",
      "type": "random-party-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "◆道具服在战斗胜利后可随机获得【磨刀石】，作用参考《重铸村雨丸》任务",
      "type": "server-drop",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "5.与年轻树精（26.12）对话，获得【树苗？】。",
      "type": "main-item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "上一步获得【艾里克的大剑】的队员，可以直接扔掉【艾里克的大剑】，再对话获得【树苗？】。",
      "type": "sword-holder-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "◆获得【艾里克的大剑】时，继续主线任务的方法：",
      "type": "route-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "⑴可以直接扔掉【艾里克的大剑】，再与下方的年轻树精（26.12）对话，获得【树苗？】，继续主线任务",
      "type": "main-drop-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "⑵持有【艾里克的大剑】时，与上方的年轻树精（32.12）对话，交出【艾里克的大剑】，选择“否”获得【树苗？】，继续主线任务；",
      "type": "main-exchange-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "（如果选“是”获得【剑？】，进入支线任务（鉴定后得到【艾里克的大剑】）。）",
      "type": "side-route-choice",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "6.前往法兰城凯蒂夫人的店（196.78）与凯蒂夫人（15.12）对话，交出30G将【树苗？】鉴定为【生命之花】。",
      "type": "appraisal-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        26
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "text": "◆【树苗？】、【生命之花】：可以卖店，卖魔石前一定要仔细检查",
      "type": "item-warning",
      "sourceLines": [
        27
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "text": "◆【树苗？】无法交易，所以需要找NPC鉴定或自己拥有鉴定技能",
      "type": "item-trade-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        28
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "text": "7.前往维诺亚村村长的家（40.36）与村长卡丹（16.7）对话，选“是”交出【生命之花】，任务完结。",
      "type": "main-completion",
      "sourceLines": [
        29
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 30,
      "text": "◆如果无法交出【生命之花】，则说明目前的职业已经交出过",
      "type": "profession-repeat-block",
      "sourceLines": [
        30
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
      "text": "◆转职后需要重新完成晋阶任务（1~4转，5转只需要1次）；",
      "type": "rank-repeat-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        31
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 32,
      "text": "◆生产系通过完成本任务亦可获得一转晋阶资格",
      "type": "rank-outcome",
      "sourceLines": [
        32
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 33,
      "text": "支线任务：（需要放弃主线任务）",
      "type": "side-route-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        33
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 34,
      "text": "4.战斗胜利后传送至叹息森林，队伍中随机1人获得【艾里克的大剑】。",
      "type": "side-route-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        34
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 35,
      "text": "5.前往维诺亚村医院与佣兵艾里克对话，交出【艾里克的大剑】获得【贤者的戒指】",
      "type": "side-completion",
      "sourceLines": [
        35
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 36,
      "text": "◆【贤者的戒指】：Lv.3戒指、耐久130~150；敏捷+3~5、精神+3~5；不可交易、丢地消失",
      "type": "equipment-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        36
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
